    python analysis/make_diag.py RAWDIR OUTDIR
writes diag_rows.parquet (part i rows), diag_cells.parquet (part ii cells), diagnostic.csv, diagnostic_groups.csv,
acceptance.csv, within_cell.csv, calibration.csv, each with a .meta.json.
Definitions fixed in ANALYSIS_PLAN.md rev. 1 (before the main runs were read)."""
